# Vue bridge, Nuxt plugins, shims

Maps: `src/runtime/vue/README.md`, `src/runtime/vue/stubs/README.md`, `src/runtime/plugins/README.md`, `src/shims/README.md`.

- `plugin.ts` `install` applies `ui` overrides, then runs `plugins/colors`. Vite `ui({ ui })` does not replace `app.use`.
- `plugins/colors.ts` only calls `generateColorCss` and `useHead`. Nuxt registers it in `module.ts`; Vue runs it from `install`.
- Keep `useAppConfig`, `useHead`, and `defineNuxtPlugin` signatures aligned across:
  - `src/shims/imports.ts` (typecheck, no behavior)
  - `src/runtime/vue/stubs/imports.ts` (Vite runtime)
  - `test/mocks/imports.ts` (Vitest)
- Shims must not touch the DOM. The Vue stub's `useHead` only writes the color `<style>` and must no-op when `document` is missing.
